== structural diagnostic (results/campaign4/tardyprobe.log) ==
  P4 27 tardy / 183 tardy-days, P5 73 / 750, P6 126 / 4045.
  Single-move earlier entry against the FINAL board: 0 of 226 tardy blocks.
  Every tardy block is locked; recoverable tardy days by single move = 0.
  Meanwhile peak POLYGON utilisation is only 0.54-0.69 (bbox utilisation
  exceeds 1.0, i.e. blocks already interlock heavily), and on P4 all waiting
  blocks would fit in the free polygon area on 43/43 queue days.
  => the remaining P4-P6 gap is dead space that crane accessibility makes
     unusable, not capacity. Any further gain needs a JOINT rearrangement of
     several incumbents; no single-block insertion rule, cost function,
     destroy size, or post-hoc polish can reach it. That is the measured
     boundary of this campaign.
